### Page 1 of 3

```text
RESOLUTION No. _____
ENTITLED:  “A RESOLUTION CERTIFYING THAT THE GOVERNING BODY OF
THE CITY OF CHEYENNE HAS AGREED ON CITY PROJECTS TO BE SUBMITTED
TO THE STATE LOAN AND INVESTMENT BOARD FOR 2011 COUNTYWIDE
CONSENSUS BLOCK GRANT FUNDING”
Whereas, the Governing Bodies of Cheyenne and Laramie County desire to participate in
the State Loan and Investment Board’s Chapter 32 Countywide Consensus Block Grant
program; and
Whereas, the rules of the State Loan and Investment Board require that application for funds
under this program be made by the Board of County Commissioners and agreed to by
municipalities representing at least 70% of the county’s incorporated population; and
Whereas, the Governing Body for Cheyenne represents greater than 70% of the incorporated
population of Laramie County;
THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING
That the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne sets forth the attached spreadsheet entitled
“Cheyenne’s 2011 Countywide Consensus Block Grant Projects”; and
That the Cheyenne Governing Body request that the Governing Body of Laramie County
make application for the projects set forth in the attached spreadsheet entitled  “Cheyenne’s 2011
Countywide Consensus Block Grant Projects”.
PASSED, APPROVED AND ADOPTED THIS 13th DAY OF JUNE, 2011
Richard L. Kaysen, Mayor
Attest:
_________________________
Carol Intlekofer, City Clerk
SLIB 11 RES Consen City.wpd
```

